#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:11
msgid "Distance Sensor (Ultrasonic)"
msgstr "距離センサー（超音波）"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:20
msgid "MaxBotix I2C Ultrasonic Sensor"
msgstr "MaxBotix I2C 超音波センサー"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst
#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:31
msgid "MB1242"
msgstr "MB1242"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:34
msgid ""
"An Ultrasonic Distance Sensor is a device that is able to measure the "
"distance between an object and the sensor.  It does this by sending out a "
"sound wave and measuring the time it takes for the wave to travel to the "
"object and back. Using this and the speed of sound the distance can be "
"calculated."
msgstr ""
"超音波距離センサーは、物体とセンサーの間の距離を測定することができるデバイスです。これは、音波を発信し、その波が物体に到達して戻ってくるまでの時間を測定することによって行われます。この時間と音速を使用して、距離を計算することができます。"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:40
msgid "Distance Sensor (Optical)"
msgstr "距離センサー（光学）"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:49
msgid "REV 2m Distance Sensor"
msgstr "REV 2m 距離センサー"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst
#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:60
msgid "REV-31-1505"
msgstr "REV-31-1505"

#: ../../source/control_hard_compon/rc_components/sensors/sensors.rst:62
msgid ""
"An Optical Time of Flight (ToF) Sensor is a device that is able to measure "
"the distance between an object and the sensor. It does this by sending out a"
" light beam and measuring the time it takes for the beam to travel to the "
"object and back. Using this time and the known speed of light the distance "
"can be calculated. Be aware that the way the object in question interacts "
"with light can change the accuracy of the distance measurement. A "
"transparent object like field panels will often provide inaccurate "
"measurements."
msgstr ""
"光学的飛行時間（ToF）センサーは、物体とセンサーの間の距離を測定できるデバイスです。"
""
"これは、光ビームを発信し、そのビームが物体まで到達して戻ってくるまでの時間を測定することで行います。"
""
"この時間と光の速度を用いて、距離を計算することができます。"
""
"対象物が光とどのように相互作用するかによって、距離測定の精度が変わることに注意してください。"
""
"フィールドパネルのような透明な物体は、しばしば不正確な測定値を提供します。"

